Subject: Pass the record identity renderer TYPO3 14.3.7 added to PageLayoutController

TYPO3 14.3.7 appended a 16th constructor argument, RecordIdentityRenderer, to
PageLayoutController. inline-page-module 4.0.2 — the newest release, published
before that patch level — still calls the parent with 15, so every request to
the Page module ends in an ArgumentCountError and the module is unusable.

--- a/Classes/InlinePageLayoutController.php	2026-09-19 08:11:14
+++ b/Classes/InlinePageLayoutController.php	2026-09-19 08:11:14
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
 use TYPO3\CMS\Backend\View\Drawing\BackendLayoutRenderer;
 use TYPO3\CMS\Backend\View\Drawing\DrawingConfiguration;
 use TYPO3\CMS\Backend\View\PageLayoutContext;
+use TYPO3\CMS\Backend\View\RecordIdentityRenderer;
 use TYPO3\CMS\Core\Database\ConnectionPool;
 use TYPO3\CMS\Core\Domain\Repository\PageRepository;
 use TYPO3\CMS\Core\Imaging\IconFactory;
@@ -68,6 +69,7 @@
         PageLinkMessageProvider $pageLinkMessageProvider,
         protected readonly DataProviderCollection $dataProviderCollection,
         SchemaLabelResolver $schemaLabelResolver,
+        RecordIdentityRenderer $recordIdentityRenderer,
     ) {
         parent::__construct(
             $componentFactory,
@@ -85,6 +87,7 @@
             $languageSelectorBuilder,
             $pageLinkMessageProvider,
             $schemaLabelResolver,
+            $recordIdentityRenderer,
         );
     }
 
